OL,3,AOfcom investigates Meta over Instagram
OL,4,AInstants feature
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfcom is investigating whether Meta
OL,7,Fbreached its duties under the UK's
OL,8,Fonline safety laws with the launch of
OL,9,Fits "Instants" feature on Instagram.
OL,11,FThe tool - allowing users to take and
OL,12,Fshare an instant image with close
OL,13,Ffriends, that disappears once viewed -
OL,14,Fwas launched on Meta's photo-sharing
OL,15,Fapp in May as "a new way to share
OL,16,Fphotos in the moment".
OL,18,FBut the regulator said the social media
OL,19,Fgiant had not properly assessed risks
OL,20,Fposed by the feature prior to launching
OL,21,Fit - something it is required to do
OL,22,Funder the UK's Online Safety Act (OSA).
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
