OL,3,ALego fraudster among last year's most
OL,4,Ahigh-profile insurance scammers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe average value of a fraudulent claim
OL,7,Freached #14,300 last year, the
OL,8,Fsecond-highest level on record, the ABI
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
