OL,3,ABritish Museum boss 'sorry' for Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry visitor issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new plans include longer opening
OL,7,Fhours, an audio guide, additional
OL,8,Fseating and clearer signage.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
